{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-armed-bandit","title":"多臂老虎机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/product-analytics-growth/experimentation/multi-armed-bandit","wordCount":1455,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"多臂老虎机\">多臂老虎机</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>多臂老虎机（Multi-Armed Bandit，MAB）算法源自一个经典的统计学问题：面对 K 台未知回报分布的老虎机，你如何制定拉杆策略，以最大化累积收益？</p>\n<p>每次选择都面临两种压力：<strong>探索（Exploration）</strong>——尝试你还不确定的选项，收集信息；<strong>利用（Exploitation）</strong>——选择当前看起来最好的选项，获取收益。过度探索意味着浪费流量；过度利用则可能错过更好的选项。</p>\n<p>在产品实验中，这个问题的实际表现是：传统 A/B 测试在整个实验期间（可能数周）都在对两个变体分配相等的流量。如果其中一个变体在第一天就明显更差，我们仍然要让它&quot;受苦&quot;的用户继续占 50% 的流量，直到实验结束。MAB 算法解决的正是这个问题：动态调整流量分配，逐渐减少表现差的变体的流量，将更多流量导向表现好的变体。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 传统AB测试&#10;        AB_A[&quot;变体 A: 50%&quot;]&#10;        AB_B[&quot;变体 B: 50%&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph MAB自适应&#10;        MAB_A[&quot;变体 A: 30%&quot;]&#10;        MAB_B[&quot;变体 B: 70%&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 传统AB测试\n        AB_A[\"变体 A: 50%\"]\n        AB_B[\"变体 B: 50%\"]\n    end\n    subgraph MAB自适应\n        MAB_A[\"变体 A: 30%\"]\n        MAB_B[\"变体 B: 70%\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"贪心算法-最简单的基线\">ε-贪心算法：最简单的基线</h2><p>ε-贪心（ε-greedy）是最简单的 MAB 算法：以概率 ε 随机选择一个臂（探索），以概率 1-ε 选择当前估计回报最高的臂（利用）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;from typing import List&#10;&#10;class EpsilonGreedy:&#10;    def __init__(self, n_arms: int, epsilon: float = 0.1):&#10;        self.n_arms = n_arms&#10;        self.epsilon = epsilon&#10;        self.counts = np.zeros(n_arms)    # 每个臂被选择的次数&#10;        self.values = np.zeros(n_arms)    # 每个臂的估计平均回报&#10;&#10;    def select_arm(self) -&gt; int:&#10;        if np.random.random() &lt; self.epsilon:&#10;            return np.random.randint(self.n_arms)   # 探索：随机选择&#10;        else:&#10;            return np.argmax(self.values)            # 利用：选最优臂&#10;&#10;    def update(self, arm: int, reward: float) -&gt; None:&#10;        self.counts[arm] += 1&#10;        # 增量均值更新（等价于平均值，但无需存储所有历史数据）&#10;        n = self.counts[arm]&#10;        self.values[arm] = self.values[arm] + (reward - self.values[arm]) / n\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> typing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> List</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EpsilonGreedy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, n_arms: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, epsilon: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.n_arms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_arms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.epsilon </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> epsilon</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.counts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.zeros(n_arms)    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 每个臂被选择的次数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.values </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.zeros(n_arms)    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 每个臂的估计平均回报</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> select_arm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.random.random() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.epsilon:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.random.randint(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.n_arms)   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 探索：随机选择</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.argmax(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.values)            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 利用：选最优臂</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, arm: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reward: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.counts[arm] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 增量均值更新（等价于平均值，但无需存储所有历史数据）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.counts[arm]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.values[arm] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.values[arm] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (reward </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.values[arm]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ε-贪心的缺陷：ε 是固定的，即使在后期已经非常确定最优臂，仍然以 ε 的概率随机探索，造成不必要的浪费。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ucb-上置信界算法\">UCB：上置信界算法</h2><p>UCB（Upper Confidence Bound）算法用一个优雅的原则解决了 ε 的选择问题：<strong>对不确定性保持乐观（Optimism in the face of uncertainty）</strong>。对于每个臂，UCB 计算其回报的上置信界，选择上置信界最高的臂。</p>\n<p>直觉上，一个臂被选择次数越少，其上置信界就越高（不确定性更大，乐观估计更高），这天然地鼓励对探索不足的臂进行探索。随着探索次数增加，上置信界会收窄，最终收敛到真实均值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class UCB1:&#10;    def __init__(self, n_arms: int):&#10;        self.n_arms = n_arms&#10;        self.counts = np.zeros(n_arms)&#10;        self.values = np.zeros(n_arms)&#10;        self.total_counts = 0&#10;&#10;    def select_arm(self) -&gt; int:&#10;        # 每个臂至少探索一次&#10;        for arm in range(self.n_arms):&#10;            if self.counts[arm] == 0:&#10;                return arm&#10;&#10;        self.total_counts = self.counts.sum()&#10;&#10;        # UCB1 公式：均值 + 探索奖励项&#10;        ucb_values = (&#10;            self.values&#10;            + np.sqrt(2 * np.log(self.total_counts) / self.counts)&#10;        )&#10;        return np.argmax(ucb_values)&#10;&#10;    def update(self, arm: int, reward: float) -&gt; None:&#10;        self.counts[arm] += 1&#10;        n = self.counts[arm]&#10;        self.values[arm] = self.values[arm] + (reward - self.values[arm]) / n\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UCB1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, n_arms: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.n_arms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_arms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.counts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.zeros(n_arms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.values </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.zeros(n_arms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.total_counts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> select_arm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 每个臂至少探索一次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> arm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.n_arms):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.counts[arm] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> arm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.total_counts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.counts.sum()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # UCB1 公式：均值 + 探索奖励项</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ucb_values </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.values</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.sqrt(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.log(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.total_counts) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.counts)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.argmax(ucb_values)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, arm: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reward: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.counts[arm] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.counts[arm]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.values[arm] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.values[arm] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (reward </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.values[arm]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>UCB 的变体</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>UCB1-Tuned</strong>：调整探索项，考虑回报的方差，更适合方差差异大的场景</li>\n<li><strong>KLUCB</strong>：使用 KL 散度代替简单的置信界，理论上最优</li>\n<li><strong>LinUCB</strong>：将 UCB 扩展到有上下文特征的场景（Contextual Bandit）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"thompson-sampling-bayesian-视角的最优探索\">Thompson Sampling：Bayesian 视角的最优探索</h2><p>Thompson Sampling（也叫后验采样）是目前实际应用中效果最好的 MAB 算法之一，也是 Statsig 等实验平台的底层算法。</p>\n<p>其工作原理：为每个臂维护一个贝叶斯后验分布（反映当前对该臂真实回报的知识状态），每次决策时从每个臂的后验分布中各采样一个值，选择采样值最大的臂。</p>\n<p>对于二值回报（转化/未转化），使用 Beta-Binomial 共轭先验：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class ThompsonSampling:&#10;    def __init__(self, n_arms: int):&#10;        self.n_arms = n_arms&#10;        # Beta(α, β) 参数：α-1 = 成功次数，β-1 = 失败次数&#10;        # 初始先验：Beta(1, 1) = Uniform（无信息先验）&#10;        self.alpha = np.ones(n_arms)&#10;        self.beta = np.ones(n_arms)&#10;&#10;    def select_arm(self) -&gt; int:&#10;        # 从每个臂的后验 Beta 分布中采样&#10;        samples = np.array([&#10;            np.random.beta(self.alpha[i], self.beta[i])&#10;            for i in range(self.n_arms)&#10;        ])&#10;        return np.argmax(samples)&#10;&#10;    def update(self, arm: int, reward: float) -&gt; None:&#10;        # 贝叶斯更新：后验 = 先验 × 似然（共轭更新，解析形式）&#10;        if reward == 1:&#10;            self.alpha[arm] += 1   # 成功：α++&#10;        else:&#10;            self.beta[arm] += 1    # 失败：β++&#10;&#10;    def get_probability_best(self, n_simulations: int = 10_000) -&gt; np.ndarray:&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;计算每个臂是最优臂的概率&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        counts = np.zeros(self.n_arms)&#10;        for _ in range(n_simulations):&#10;            samples = np.array([&#10;                np.random.beta(self.alpha[i], self.beta[i])&#10;                for i in range(self.n_arms)&#10;            ])&#10;            counts[np.argmax(samples)] += 1&#10;        return counts / n_simulations&#10;&#10;# 使用示例：三个版本的按钮文案 A/B/C 测试&#10;bandit = ThompsonSampling(n_arms=3)&#10;&#10;# 模拟 1000 次交互&#10;true_rates = [0.05, 0.08, 0.06]  # 真实转化率（未知，模拟用）&#10;total_rewards = 0&#10;&#10;for t in range(1000):&#10;    arm = bandit.select_arm()&#10;    reward = 1 if np.random.random() &lt; true_rates[arm] else 0&#10;    bandit.update(arm, reward)&#10;    total_rewards += reward&#10;&#10;print(f&quot;总累积奖励: {total_rewards}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;各臂被选择次数: {bandit.alpha + bandit.beta - 2}&quot;)  # α+β-2 = 总选择次数&#10;print(f&quot;各臂是最优臂的概率: {bandit.get_probability_best()}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ThompsonSampling</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, n_arms: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.n_arms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_arms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # Beta(α, β) 参数：α-1 = 成功次数，β-1 = 失败次数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 初始先验：Beta(1, 1) = Uniform（无信息先验）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.ones(n_arms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.beta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.ones(n_arms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> select_arm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 从每个臂的后验 Beta 分布中采样</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        samples </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.array([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            np.random.beta(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alpha[i], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.beta[i])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.n_arms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.argmax(samples)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span styl