an><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.08</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.06</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 真实转化率（未知，模拟用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">total_rewards </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    arm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bandit.select_arm()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    reward </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.random.random() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> true_rates[arm] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    bandit.update(arm, reward)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total_rewards </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reward</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"总累积奖励: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">total_rewards</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"各臂被选择次数: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bandit.alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bandit.beta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># α+β-2 = 总选择次数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"各臂是最优臂的概率: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">bandit.get_probability_best()</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Thompson Sampling 的优势</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>自然的概率性探索：当某个臂是最优臂的概率高时，它被选择的频率也高</li>\n<li>不需要手动调节超参数（不像 UCB 的探索系数）</li>\n<li>可以直接输出&quot;某个变体是最优的概率&quot;，支持更直观的决策</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"contextual-bandit-个性化推荐的核心\">Contextual Bandit：个性化推荐的核心</h2><p>Contextual Bandit 在 MAB 的基础上引入了用户上下文特征。决策不再是&quot;哪个臂在所有用户上表现最好&quot;，而是&quot;对于这个特定的用户（具有这些特征），哪个臂表现最好&quot;。</p>\n<p>这是个性化推荐的理论基础——每个用户看到的内容、界面、价格都可以不同，根据其历史行为和个人特征动态选择最优方案。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from sklearn.linear_model import Ridge&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;class LinUCB:&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;线性 UCB：Contextual Bandit 的经典算法（Li et al., 2010）&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;&#10;    def __init__(self, n_arms: int, n_features: int, alpha: float = 1.0):&#10;        self.n_arms = n_arms&#10;        self.alpha = alpha&#10;        # 每个臂的参数矩阵&#10;        self.A = [np.eye(n_features) for _ in range(n_arms)]  # d×d 矩阵&#10;        self.b = [np.zeros(n_features) for _ in range(n_arms)]  # d 维向量&#10;&#10;    def select_arm(self, context: np.ndarray) -&gt; int:&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        context: 用户特征向量（形状为 (n_features,)）&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        ucb_values = []&#10;        for arm in range(self.n_arms):&#10;            A_inv = np.linalg.inv(self.A[arm])&#10;            theta = A_inv @ self.b[arm]   # 参数估计&#10;            # UCB 值 = 预测回报 + 探索奖励&#10;            ucb = theta @ context + self.alpha * np.sqrt(context @ A_inv @ context)&#10;            ucb_values.append(ucb)&#10;        return np.argmax(ucb_values)&#10;&#10;    def update(self, arm: int, context: np.ndarray, reward: float) -&gt; None:&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        在线更新：每次交互后更新对应臂的参数矩阵&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        self.A[arm] += np.outer(context, context)&#10;        self.b[arm] += reward * context\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sklearn.linear_model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Ridge</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LinUCB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"线性 UCB：Contextual Bandit 的经典算法（Li et al., 2010）\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, n_arms: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n_features: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, alpha: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.n_arms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n_arms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 每个臂的参数矩阵</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.A </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [np.eye(n_features) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n_arms)]  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># d×d 矩阵</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [np.zeros(n_features) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n_arms)]  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># d 维向量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> select_arm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, context: np.ndarray) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        context: 用户特征向量（形状为 (n_features,)）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ucb_values </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> arm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.n_arms):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            A_inv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.linalg.inv(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.A[arm])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            theta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> A_inv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.b[arm]   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 参数估计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            # UCB 值 = 预测回报 + 探索奖励</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            ucb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> theta </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> context </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.sqrt(context </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> A_inv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">@</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> context)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            ucb_values.append(ucb)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.argmax(ucb_values)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, arm: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, context: np.ndarray, reward: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        在线更新：每次交互后更新对应臂的参数矩阵</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.A[arm] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.outer(context, context)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.b[arm] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reward </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> context</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"mab-与传统-a-b-测试-何时选哪个\">MAB 与传统 A/B 测试：何时选哪个</h2><p>MAB 不是 A/B 测试的替代品，两者有不同的适用场景：</p>\n<p><strong>选择传统 A/B 测试的场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>需要确定性的统计结论（p &lt; 0.05）以支持重大决策（定价变化、核心功能改动）</li>\n<li>实验期间样本量充足，无需担心流量浪费</li>\n<li>监管或合规要求需要传统统计检验结果</li>\n<li>实验持续时间短，自适应带来的收益有限</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>选择 MAB 的场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>多变体测试（5+ 个变体），传统 A/B 需要极大样本量</li>\n<li>优化追求&quot;实验期间&quot;的累积收益，而非事后的最优选择（如每日推送文案）</li>\n<li>变体效果随时间变化（季节性、用户群体变化）</li>\n<li>个性化场景，需要对不同用户展示不同变体</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>传统 A/B 测试</th>\n<th>MAB</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>流量效率</td>\n<td>低（固定50/50分配）</td>\n<td>高（动态向最优变体倾斜）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>统计结论</td>\n<td>正式的假设检验</td>\n<td>概率性结论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样本量需求</td>\n<td>需预先计算</td>\n<td>无严格要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合变体数量</td>\n<td>2-4个</td>\n<td>2-50+个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决策时机</td>\n<td>实验结束后</td>\n<td>任意时刻（后验概率驱动）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>个性化</td>\n<td>不支持（Contextual MAB可以）</td>\n<td>Contextual MAB 支持</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>多臂老虎机算法在探索与利用的权衡问题上提供了比传统 A/B 测试更灵活的解决方案。ε-贪心以固定概率随机探索，实现简单但效率有限；UCB1 通过&quot;乐观面对不确定性&quot;原则，为探索不足的臂给予更高权重，理论上可证明对数级遗憾界；Thompson Sampling 以贝叶斯后验采样实现自然的概率性探索，无需手动调参，是 Statsig 等主流实验平台的底层算法。LinUCB 将 MAB 扩展到引入用户上下文特征的个性化场景，是推荐系统的理论基础。在实践中，MAB 与传统 A/B 测试各有适用场景：MAB 适合多变体优化、实验期收益最大化和个性化推荐；传统 A/B 测试适合需要严格统计结论、支撑重大业务决策的场景。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多臂老虎机","id":"多臂老虎机"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ε-贪心算法：最简单的基线","id":"贪心算法-最简单的基线"},{"level":2,"text":"UCB：上置信界算法","id":"ucb-上置信界算法"},{"level":2,"text":"Thompson Sampling：Bayesian 视角的最优探索","id":"thompson-sampling-bayesian-视角的最优探索"},{"level":2,"text":"Contextual Bandit：个性化推荐的核心","id":"contextual-bandit-个性化推荐的核心"},{"level":2,"text":"MAB 与传统 A/B 测试：何时选哪个","id":"mab-与传统-a-b-测试-何时选哪个"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"样本量与统计功效","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/product-analytics-growth/experimentation/sample-size-statistical-power"},"next":{"title":"北极星指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/product-analytics-growth/growth/north-star-metrics"}}